ITEM R5: DATA ACQUISITION & LICENSING CONSTRAINTS
================================================================================
No raw input data is redistributed in this repository.
1. ERA5: Copernicus Licence v1.2 (no share-alike). Sourced via GEE or WB2.
2. SRTM 30m: USGS/NASA Public Domain. Sourced via GEE asset USGS/SRTMGL1_003.
3. DataMeet Village Boundaries: Open Database Licence (ODbL v1.0).
   Section 4.4 imposes share-alike obligations on adapted databases. To maintain
   strict compliance, NO POLYGON GEOMETRY is committed to git. Attributes in
   outputs/village_corrections.csv are keyed to census_code and state_loc_code.
4. GHCN-Daily: NOAA NCEI Public Domain. Fetched via fetch_ghcn_daily.py.
5. MODIS MYD11A1: NASA LP DAAC Public Domain. Parked feature only.

