================================================================================
ITEM R9: TROUBLESHOOTING & LIMITATIONS
================================================================================
Limitations fully documented:
  1. Static elevation-only adjustment (no microclimatic canopy or albedo model).
  2. Fixed environmental lapse rate (Gamma = 6.5 C/km; nocturnal regime null result in G4).
  3. Historical reconstruction, not forward NWP forecast.
  4. Three-year validation window (2015-06-01 to 2018-05-31).
  5. Belgaum (IN009021000) excluded from validation due to circularity and 2004 reporting break.
  6. Frost/cold-air pooling feature parked at NO-GO due to MODIS skin vs air temperature mismatch.

